<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= 'منصة انطلق العالمية - تعليم مباشر احترافي' %></title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Tajawal:wght@400;500;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/feather-icons"></script>
    <style>
        body { 
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif; 
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            background-color: #fcfcfd;
        }

        /* Hero Gradient & Pattern */
        .hero-background {
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%, #4f46e5 0%, #312e81 100%);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero-background::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background-image: url("https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/cubes.png");
            opacity: 0.05;
        }

        /* Smooth Slider */
        @keyframes slide {
            0% { transform: translateX(0%); }
            100% { transform: translateX(-50%); } 
        }
        .auto-slider {
            display: flex;
            animation: slide 30s linear infinite; 
            width: max-content; 
        }
        .auto-slider:hover { animation-play-state: paused; }

        .slide-item {
            width: 500px; 
            flex-shrink: 0;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        /* Advanced Card Styling */
        .course-card-style {
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .course-card-style:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px); 
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.2);
            border-color: #4f46e5;
        }

        /* Glassmorphism Effect */
        .glass-effect {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        /* Custom Scrollbar */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #f1f1f1; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #4f46e5; border-radius: 10px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-gray-900">

    <header class="sticky top-0 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-gray-100 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-20 flex justify-between items-center">
            
            <a href="/admin" class="group flex items-center">
                <div class="bg-indigo-600 p-2 rounded-lg ml-3 group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform">
                    <i data-feather="globe" class="text-white w-6 h-6"></i>
                </div>
                <span class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 tracking-tight">انطلق <span class="text-indigo-600">.</span></span>
            </a>
            
            <nav class="hidden md:flex items-center space-x-8 space-x-reverse">
                <a href="#courses" class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-600 hover:text-indigo-600 transition">الكورسات</a>
                <a href="#features" class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-600 hover:text-indigo-600 transition">المميزات</a>
                <a href="#testimonials" class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-600 hover:text-indigo-600 transition">قالوا عنّا</a>
            </nav>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                <a href="./student/login" class="hidden sm:block text-sm font-bold text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl transition">
                    تسجيل الدخول
                </a>
                <a href="/student/register" class="px-6 py-2.5 bg-indigo-600 text-white text-sm font-bold rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-indigo-200 hover:bg-indigo-700 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition active:scale-95">
                    ابدأ رحلتك
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="hero-background py-20 lg:py-32 text-white">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-16 relative z-10">
                
                <div class="lg:w-1/2 text-center lg:text-right space-y-8">
                    <div class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-indigo-100 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase">
                        🚀 مستقبل التعليم بين يديك
                    </div>
                    <h1 class="text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-black leading-tight italic">
                        دراسة فردية، <br><span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-200 to-white">نتائج استثنائية.</span>
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-xl text-indigo-100/80 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
                        منصة تعليم مباشر عالمية مصممة لتحقيق أهدافك الأكاديمية والمهنية بدعم من أفضل المعلمين الخبراء حول العالم.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center lg:justify-start">
                        <a href="/student/register" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-rose-500 hover:bg-rose-600 text-white text-lg font-black rounded-2xl shadow-xl shadow-rose-900/20 transition-all hover:scale-105 active:scale-95">
                            <i data-feather="zap" class="ml-2 w-5 h-5"></i>
                            سجل الآن مجاناً
                        </a>
                        <div class="flex -space-x-3 space-x-reverse items-center justify-center">
                            <img class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-indigo-500 shadow-lg" src="https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=1" alt="student">
                            <img class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-indigo-500 shadow-lg" src="https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=2" alt="student">
                            <img class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-indigo-500 shadow-lg" src="https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=3" alt="student">
                            <span class="mr-4 text-sm font-bold text-indigo-200">+12K طالب انضموا إلينا</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="lg:w-5/12 relative">
                    <div class="absolute -inset-10 bg-indigo-500/30 blur-[100px] rounded-full animate-pulse"></div>
                    <div class="relative bg-white/5 p-4 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-2xl rotate-3 hover:rotate-0 transition duration-700">
                        <img src="https://surahquran.com/img/core-img/ghilafquran.png" class="w-full rounded-[2rem] shadow-inner object-cover" alt="Hero Image"> 
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        
        <section class="py-12 -mt-10 relative z-20">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-xl shadow-gray-200/50 border border-gray-50 text-center transform transition hover:-translate-y-2">
                        <p class="text-4xl font-black text-indigo-600">12K+</p>
                        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-400 mt-2 uppercase tracking-tighter">طالب عالمي</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-xl shadow-gray-200/50 border border-gray-50 text-center transform transition hover:-translate-y-2">
                        <p class="text-4xl font-black text-indigo-600">98%</p>
                        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-400 mt-2 uppercase tracking-tighter">نسبة النجاح</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-xl shadow-gray-200/50 border border-gray-50 text-center transform transition hover:-translate-y-2">
                        <p class="text-4xl font-black text-indigo-600">500+</p>
                        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-400 mt-2 uppercase tracking-tighter">معلم معتمد</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-xl shadow-gray-200/50 border border-gray-50 text-center transform transition hover:-translate-y-2">
                        <p class="text-4xl font-black text-indigo-600">24/7</p>
                        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-400 mt-2 uppercase tracking-tighter">دعم فني</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="courses" class="py-24 bg-gray-50">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end mb-16 gap-6">
                    <div class="text-right">
                        <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-gray-900"><%= 'كورسات صُممت لنجاحك' %></h2> 
                        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-500 max-w-lg">اختر من بين مئات التخصصات الأكاديمية مع أفضل المعلمين لتعلم تفاعلي حقيقي.</p>
                    </div>
                    <a href="/website-courses" class="group flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-white border-2 border-indigo-600 text-indigo-600 font-bold rounded-2xl hover:bg-indigo-600 hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">
                        عرض جميع الكورسات <i data-feather="arrow-left" class="mr-2 w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
                
                <div id="courses-container" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
                    <% if (typeof courses !== 'undefined' && courses.length > 0) { %>
                        <% courses.slice(0, 6).forEach(function(course) { %>
                            <div class="group bg-white rounded-[2rem] shadow-sm overflow-hidden course-card-style">
                                <div class="relative overflow-hidden">
                                    <img src="<%= course.coverImage || 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516321318423-f06f85e504b3?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80' %>"
                                         alt="<%= course.name %>" 
                                         class="w-full h-56 object-cover transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-110">
                                    <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-black text-indigo-600 shadow-sm">
                                        دروس مباشرة
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="p-8">
                                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition"><%= course.name %></h3>
                                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed line-clamp-2 mb-6"><%= course.description %></p>
                                    
                                    <div class="pt-6 border-t border-gray-50 flex items-center justify-between">
                                        <span class="flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-gray-400">
                                            <i data-feather="users" class="ml-1 w-4 h-4"></i> متاح الآن
                                        </span>
                                        <a href="/website-course/<%= course.id %>" class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-gray-900 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-xl hover:bg-indigo-600 transition">تفاصيل الكورس</a>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        <% }); %>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <div class="md:col-span-3 text-center py-20 bg-white rounded-[2rem] border-2 border-dashed border-gray-200">
                            <div class="bg-gray-50 w-20 h-20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
                                <i data-feather="search" class="w-10 h-10 text-gray-300"></i>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-400">لا توجد كورسات متاحة حالياً</p>
                        </div>
                    <% } %>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="features" class="py-24 bg-white relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
                <div class="text-center mb-20">
                    <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-gray-900">لماذا يفضلنا المبدعون؟</h2>
                    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-500">نظام تعليمي ذكي يركز على الطالب أولاً</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
                    <div class="p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-indigo-50 border border-transparent hover:border-indigo-200 transition group">
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition">
                            <i data-feather="video" class="w-7 h-7 text-indigo-600"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-black text-xl mb-3">فصول LIVE</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">تفاعل مباشر وجهاً لوجه مع معلمك الخاص في بيئة تعليمية آمنة.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-rose-50 border border-transparent hover:border-rose-200 transition group">
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition">
                            <i data-feather="calendar" class="w-7 h-7 text-rose-500"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-black text-xl mb-3">مرونة تامة</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">اختر المواعيد التي تناسب نمط حياتك، خدمتنا متاحة على مدار الساعة.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-amber-50 border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200 transition group">
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition">
                            <i data-feather="database" class="w-7 h-7 text-amber-500"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-black text-xl mb-3">أرشيف الحصص</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">جميع حصصك مسجلة بجودة عالية للرجوع إليها في أي وقت للمراجعة.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-emerald-50 border border-transparent hover:border-emerald-200 transition group">
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition">
                            <i data-feather="target" class="w-7 h-7 text-emerald-600"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-black text-xl mb-3">خطة مخصصة</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">لا نؤمن بالقوالب الجاهزة؛ كل طالب يحصل على منهج يناسب مستواه.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="testimonials" class="py-24 bg-slate-900 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-white text-center mb-16">قصص نجاح طلابنا</h2>
                
                <div class="relative">
                    <div class="auto-slider">
                        <div class="slide-item">
                            <div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md p-10 rounded-[3rem] border border-white/10 h-full">
                                <div class="flex text-amber-400 mb-6 italic">
                                    <i data-feather="star" class="fill-current w-4 h-4"></i>
                                    <i data-feather="star" class="fill-current w-4 h-4"></i>
                                    <i data-feather="star" class="fill-current w-4 h-4"></i>
                                    <i data-feather="star" class="fill-current w-4 h-4"></i>
                                    <i data-feather="star" class="fill-current w-4 h-4"></i>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-xl font-medium text-indigo-100 leading-relaxed mb-8">
                                    "تجربة استثنائية! المنصة وفرت لي أفضل معلم فيزياء، الشرح كان مبسطاً جداً وتفوقت في اختباري النهائي."
                                </p>
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-indigo-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white">س</div>
                                    <div>
                                        <p class="font-black text-white">سارة المنصوري</p>
                                        <p class="text-indigo-400 text-xs">طالبة هندسة - الإمارات</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="slide-item">
                            <div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md p-10 rounded-[3rem] border border-white/10 h-full">
                                <div class="flex text-amber-400 mb-6 italic">
                                    <i data-feather="star" class="fill-current w-4 h-4"></i>
                                    <i data-feather="star" class="fill-current w-4 h-4"></i>
                                    <i data-feather="star" class="fill-current w-4 h-4"></i>
                                    <i data-feather="star" class="fill-current w-4 h-4"></i>
                                    <i data-feather="star" class="fill-current w-4 h-4"></i>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-xl font-medium text-indigo-100 leading-relaxed mb-8">
                                    "بفضل الجلسات المكثفة للغة الإنجليزية، حصلت على درجة 7.5 في الأيلتس. الجدولة مرنة جداً ومريحة."
                                </p>
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-rose-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white">أ</div>
                                    <div>
                                        <p class="font-black text-white">أحمد الرشيد</p>
                                        <p class="text-indigo-400 text-xs">طالب ثانوي - السعودية</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="slide-item">
                            <div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md p-10 rounded-[3rem] border border-white/10 h-full">
                                <div class="flex text-amber-400 mb-6 italic">
                                    <i data-feather="star" class="fill-current w-4 h-4"></i>
                                    <i data-feather="star" class="fill-current w-4 h-4"></i>
                                    <i data-feather="star" class="fill-current w-4 h-4"></i>
                                    <i data-feather="star" class="fill-current w-4 h-4"></i>
                                    <i data-feather="star" class="fill-current w-4 h-4"></i>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-xl font-medium text-indigo-100 leading-relaxed mb-8">
                                    "انصح الجميع بالاشتراك، المعلمين هنا ليسوا فقط مدرسين بل هم موجهين حقيقيين يساعدونك على التطور."
                                </p>
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white">م</div>
                                    <div>
                                        <p class="font-black text-white">محمد خالد</p>
                                        <p class="text-indigo-400 text-xs">طالب حاسبات - مصر</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-indigo-50">
            <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <div class="bg-indigo-600 rounded-[3rem] p-12 lg:p-20 text-center relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-indigo-300">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full opacity-10">
                         <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="w-full h-full"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" stroke="white" stroke-width="0.5" fill="none"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-white mb-6 relative z-10">هل أنت مستعد لتغيير مستقبلك؟</h2>
                    <p class="text-xl text-indigo-100 mb-10 relative z-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                        انضم إلى آلاف الطلاب الذين حققوا أحلامهم من خلال منصتنا. ابدأ اليوم حصتك الأولى.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center relative z-10">
                        <a href="/student/register" class="px-10 py-4 bg-white text-indigo-600 text-xl font-black rounded-2xl hover:bg-indigo-50 transition-all shadow-xl shadow-indigo-900/20">
                            إنشاء حساب طالب <i data-feather="user-plus" class="mr-2 inline-block"></i>
                        </a>
                        <a href="/teacher/register" class="px-10 py-4 bg-indigo-500 text-white text-xl font-black rounded-2xl border border-indigo-400 hover:bg-indigo-400 transition-all">
                            انضم كمعلم
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
    
    <footer class="bg-slate-950 text-white pt-24 pb-12 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 relative z-10">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-16 mb-20">
                
                <div class="space-y-6">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/50">
                            <i data-feather="zap" class="w-6 h-6 text-white"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tighter">انطلق<span class="text-indigo-500">.</span></span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        المنصة العالمية الرائدة التي تربط الطلاب بأفضل المعلمين لتقديم تجربة تعليمية فردية ومباشرة لا مثيل لها.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-black mb-8 text-white">المنصة</h4>
                    <ul class="space-y-4 text-slate-400 font-bold text-sm">
                        <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-indigo-400 transition">عن انطلق</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#courses" class="hover:text-indigo-400 transition">جميع الكورسات</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-indigo-400 transition">الأسئلة الشائعة</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-indigo-400 transition">سياسة الخصوصية</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-black mb-8 text-white">المعلمون</h4>
                    <ul class="space-y-4 text-slate-400 font-bold text-sm">
                        <li><a href="/teacher/register" class="hover:text-indigo-400 transition">انضم كمعلم</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/teacher/login" class="hover:text-indigo-400 transition">تسجيل دخول المعلمين</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-indigo-400 transition">مركز المساعدة</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-black mb-8 text-white">تواصل معنا</h4>
                    <div class="flex gap-4 mb-8">
